  noteLetter: 
  title: Sir Ragnar found
  text: An alarm sounds! Sir Ragnar is freed. All remaining monsters, doors and furniture
    appear and every door is opened. The hero who opened the cell moves the knight
    after his own turn (1 red die). Sir Ragnar does not attack, defends with 2 dice
    and has only 2 body points.
